	<key>readme</key>
	<string># GitHub Quick Access Workflow

## Usage

Type `gh` followed by:
- A repo name (fuzzy matched) to open it
- `pr` for pull requests
- `issues` for your issues
- `notif` for notifications
- `gists` for your gists
- `refresh` to update the repo cache

## Modifier Keys on Repos
- Cmd+Enter: Open issues
- Alt+Enter: Open pull requests
- Ctrl+Enter: Copy clone URL

## Extending
Add new commands by editing commands.json</string>
